[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3564.15, "timestamp": "00:59:24", "text": "我覺得那是牛排。呃，烤牛排之類的。  我看起來……還有我們之前遇到的那個賣馬鈴薯的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3567.27, "timestamp": "00:59:27", "text": "人，他還在這裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3582.47, "timestamp": "00:59:42", "text": "所以，是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3599.19, "timestamp": "00:59:59", "text": "這就像《"}]